WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Compare two verified MicroPython builds. Flash +8,240 bytes. RAM +4,096 bytes.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with PASS: Flash growth 8,240; RAM growth 4,096. Total usage also passes.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Edit only RAM growth: 4,096 to 4,095. Actual 4,096 exceeds the limit by one byte. Engine exit 2.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Restore RAM growth to 4,096. The same firmware comparison returns PASS.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Candidate 0.3.4 adds Linux CI, multiple memory banks and conservative object/archive attribution.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Install the candidate for your platform. Engine runs locally. No telemetry or automatic upload.

